# SoNo — Sổ Nợ (Family Debt Tracker)

Vietnamese family debt ledger. Owner records debts; sister logs payments with receipts; owner gets email on each payment.

## Goals
- Owner adds debts (item, amount, date, notes), views ledger, sees remaining balance.
- Sister sees balance owed, submits payments + receipt image, sees own history.
- Email notification to owner on each new payment.
- Mobile-first PWA-friendly UI (no PWA install required).

## Tech Stack (locked)
- Next.js 15 (App Router, Server Components, Server Actions)
- Supabase (Postgres + Auth + Storage)
- Resend (transactional email via DB webhook → Next.js route handler)
- Cloudflare Pages + `@cloudflare/next-on-pages`
- Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui

## Phases

| # | Phase | File | Status | Est |
|---|-------|------|--------|-----|
| 1 | Project Setup | [phase-01-project-setup.md](./phase-01-project-setup.md) | pending | 3h |
| 2 | Database & Auth | [phase-02-database-auth.md](./phase-02-database-auth.md) | pending | 3h |
| 3 | Owner Features | [phase-03-owner-features.md](./phase-03-owner-features.md) | pending | 4h |
| 4 | Sister Features | [phase-04-sister-features.md](./phase-04-sister-features.md) | pending | 5h |
| 5 | Email Notifications | [phase-05-email-notifications.md](./phase-05-email-notifications.md) | pending | 3h |
| 6 | UI Polish | [phase-06-ui-polish.md](./phase-06-ui-polish.md) | pending | 4h |

## Key Dependencies
- Phase 2 depends on Phase 1 (Supabase client wired).
- Phases 3 & 4 depend on Phase 2 (schema, RLS, auth).
- Phase 5 depends on Phase 4 (payments table populated).
- Phase 6 runs alongside 3/4 (UI polish iterates on real screens).

## Out of Scope (YAGNI)
Multi-family groups, real-time, push notifications, admin panel, analytics, multi-currency, debt categories.

## Success
