// 6. redirect(`/books/${newBook.id}`)
```

4. **`app/books/page.tsx`** — two sections: "Tôi cho nợ" (creditor) + "Tôi nợ" (debtor). Each book shows name, partner name/email, balance chip.

5. **`app/books/[bookId]/layout.tsx`**:
```ts
