if (!book) notFound();
const isCreditor = book.creditor_id === me.id;
const isDebtor   = book.debtor_id   === me.id;
if (!isCreditor && !isDebtor) redirect('/books'); // not a member
```
Pass `isCreditor` / `bookId` to children via context (use `searchParams` workaround or re-fetch in page).

6. **`app/books/[bookId]/page.tsx`** — summary card (totals), role-conditional sections:
   - If creditor: debt list + pending payments to approve
   - If debtor: balance card + recent payments with status badges

7. **Bottom nav per-book**: 3 links using `[bookId]` in hrefs; different links per `isCreditor`.

